# Plan todos checked off

When executing a **Plan → Build**, **implement the plan**, **execute the plan**, or equivalent, update that plan's todo checkboxes in the same turn as the work.

## Where

The plan file's YAML frontmatter. Each todo has `status: pending` or `status: completed`. That status is the checkbox.

## Do

- As soon as a todo's work is finished, set that todo to `status: completed`.
- Before the handoff that says the plan (or this pause) is done, re-read the frontmatter and confirm every finished todo is `completed`.
- Leave a todo `pending` only when its work was not done. Say so in the handoff.
- Per-todo pauses: check off only the todos finished in that pause.

## Do not

- Leave finished todos at `pending` until the user asks.
- Mark a todo completed when its work is still open.

